# Build-context filter for services/api-gateway/Dockerfile (context: repository root).
*
!packages/service-auth
!services/api-gateway
# Embedded at compile time (generated, checked by CI): the route manifest and the
# public OpenAPI documents.
!infra/api-gateway/route-manifest.json
!infra/api-gateway/sdk-discovery.json
!packages/contracts/bundled/public

**/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.secret
**/*.log
services/api-gateway/Dockerfile
services/api-gateway/Dockerfile.dockerignore
